OL,3,GNEWSAFundamental health plans due
OL,4,Abefore end of 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals which could see people in
OL,7,FGuernsey pay more for healthcare are
OL,8,Fdue to be published before the end of
OL,9,Fnext year.
OL,11,FHealth and Social Care (HSC) started
OL,12,Fwork on the creation of a new model for
OL,13,Fhealthcare locally last year, and
OL,14,Fwarned it could see people pay more for
OL,15,Fthings like meals at hospital and
OL,16,Ftreatments.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
