OL,1,W5j 5Q7+jp5w{j#57kjs15  jjs1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFundamental health plans due
OL,4,Abefore end of 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe committee has made it the top
OL,7,Fpriority in its workplan for the
OL,8,Fpolitical term and HSC President George
OL,9,FOswald said he believed a policy letter
OL,10,Fon the plans would be published before
OL,11,Fthe end of 2027.
OL,13,FOswald said: "This will probably
OL,14,Frequire some fairly difficult decisions
OL,15,Ffor both the island to make as a whole
OL,16,Fand for the States of Guernsey in
OL,17,Fparticular to make."
